LangName: 1033 "" "" "" "" "" "Version 1.001" "" "Oldenburg is a trademark of Sorkin Type Co." "Nicole Fally" "Nicole Fally" "Oldenburg is inspired by nearly monoline handwritting seen on a series of German posters. It has been changed and adaped to be more broadly useful design than a more faithful interpretation would have been. Despite the increased ulity in Oldernburg it still presenst plenty of the whimsical feeling that made it's source so attractive. Oldenburg can be used a in a wide range of sizes." "sorkintype.com" "sorkintype.com" "This Font Software is licensed under the SIL Open Font License, Version 1.1. This license is available with a FAQ at: http://scripts.sil.org/OFL" "http://scripts.sil.org/OFL" "" "" "" "Oldenburg"
